# artifacts/ is a byte-exact content-addressed copy of baseline/ and candidate/,
# both of which ARE committed. It is regenerated deterministically by the two
# candidate-freeze commands in README.md section 1, and the address self-verifies
# (a re-freeze returns created:false only if the stored bytes still hash to it).
artifacts/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
